      "@type": ["Dataset", "ResearchObject"],
      "name": "SST Gap-Filling: Sphere vs WGS84 Ellipsoid on HEALPix",
      "description": "Tests whether WGS84 ellipsoidal HEALPix improves scattering-transform SST gap-filling compared to the standard spherical HEALPix assumption. At operational resolution (nside=128), WGS84 reduces RMSE by 12.6 % (1333 -> 1165 mK); at nside=32, the improvement is negligible (0.14 %). The benefit scales with resolution.",
